  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Fix uintptr_t not found error",
  "description": "OS: SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 12 SP5.\n\nCompilation of the Wireshark source code of the branch `wireshark-3.6.20` results in the error.\n\n> ./asn1/kerberos/packet-kerberos-template.c:2022:26: error: ‘uintptr_t’ undeclared (first use in this function); did you mean ‘intptr_t’?\n\nI believe the issue is that the include statement gets introduced by one of the #if blocks, but is guaranteed to be there in all cases. I didn't test on the latest due to not having access to a suitable Linux box at the moment, but the fix remains the same.",
  "state": "merged",
